@startuml trial-playback
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title SD22: Kiểm Soát Nghe Thử Nguyên Tử & Cấp Quyền Phát Âm Thanh (Trial Playback)

box "Client (Web / Mobile)" #f8fafc
  participant "Ứng Dụng\n(Narration Player)" as Player
end box

box "TourVoice Backend (FastAPI)" #f0fdf4
  participant "Access Router" as Router
  participant "AccessService" as AccessSvc
  participant "TrialService" as TrialSvc
  participant "Audio Endpoint" as AudioEP
  participant "AudioService" as AudioSvc
end box

box "Cơ Sở Dữ Liệu (MongoDB)" #eff6ff
  database "trial_usage" as DB_Trial
  database "playback_grants" as DB_Grants
end box

== 1. Yêu Cầu Cấp Quyền Phát Âm Thanh (Playback Grant) ==
Player -> Router: POST /api/v1/playback-grants\n{tour_id, poi_id, lang: "vi", trigger_source: "manual", consent_trial: true}\n[Header: X-Guest-Token hoặc Bearer]
Router -> AccessSvc: request_playback_grant(req)

AccessSvc -> AccessSvc: 1. Kiểm tra quyền sở hữu tour (Entitlement)
note right: Nếu đã mua tour -> Cấp ngay scope "entitled"\nkhông trừ lượt nghe thử!

alt Chưa sở hữu tour
  AccessSvc -> AccessSvc: 2. Kiểm tra tour có cho nghe thử (preview_enabled)
  AccessSvc -> AccessSvc: 3. Kiểm tra sự đồng ý (consent_trial == true)
  
  alt GPS tự động kích hoạt nhưng consent_trial == false
    AccessSvc --> Router: Error 403: TRIAL_CONSENT_REQUIRED
    Router --> Player: Trả về yêu cầu du khách xác nhận đồng ý nghe thử
  end
  
  AccessSvc -> TrialSvc: reserve_trial_quota(subject, tour_id, poi_id, lang)
  TrialSvc -> DB_Trial: find_one_and_update(\n  {subject_type, subject_id, state: "available"},\n  {$set: {state: "reserved", reservation_id, expires_at: now + 5m}}\n)
  
  alt Quota đã hết (state != "available")
    TrialSvc --> AccessSvc: Failed (TRIAL_EXHAUSTED)
    AccessSvc --> Router: Error 403: TOUR_PURCHASE_REQUIRED
    Router --> Player: Paywall hiển thị yêu cầu mua tour
  else Đặt trước thành công
    TrialSvc --> AccessSvc: Reserved OK (reservation_id)
    AccessSvc -> AccessSvc: Sinh grant_token bí mật (32 bytes ngẫu nhiên)
    AccessSvc -> DB_Grants: insert_one({\n  grant_token, scope: "trial", tour_id, poi_id,\n  asset_storage_key, expires_at: now + 15m, delivery_state: "issued"\n})
    
    AccessSvc -> TrialSvc: consume_trial_quota(subject, reservation_id)
    TrialSvc -> DB_Trial: update_one(\n  {reservation_id},\n  {$set: {state: "consumed", consumed_at: now}}\n)
    
    AccessSvc --> Router: {granted: true, scope: "trial", grant_token, stream_url}
    Router --> Player: 200 OK: Trả về grant_token & stream_url
  end
end

== 2. Phát Luồng Âm Thanh Bảo Vệ (Gated Media Stream) ==
Player -> AudioEP: GET /api/v1/audio/audio/poi_01_vi.mp3/stream?grant_token={grant_token}\n[Header: Range: bytes=0-...]
AudioEP -> AccessSvc: verify_grant_token(grant_token, storage_key)
AccessSvc -> DB_Grants: find_one({grant_token, expires_at: {$gt: now}})
AccessSvc -> DB_Grants: update_one({_id}, {$set: {delivery_state: "delivered"}})
AccessSvc --> AudioEP: Authorized OK

AudioEP -> AudioSvc: stream_audio_file(storage_key, range_header)
AudioSvc --> Player: HTTP 206 Partial Content (Audio Stream Chạy Mượt Mà)

== 3. Tạm Dừng / Tiếp Tục Cùng Bài Nghe (Pause / Resume) ==
Player -> AudioEP: GET /api/v1/audio/.../stream?grant_token={grant_token} (Cùng token còn hạn)
AudioEP --> Player: HTTP 206 Partial Content (Không tốn thêm quota)
@enduml
